                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA, Mfalme wa Israeli, Mkombozi wako, BWANA wa majeshi, asema hivi; Mimi ni wa kwanza, na mimi ni wa mwisho; zaidi yangu mimi hapana Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye ni nani kama mimi atakayeita, na kuyahubiri haya, na kunitengenezea, tangu nilipowaweka watu wa kale? Na mambo yanayokuja na yatakayotokea, wayatangaze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:8"
          },
